{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iQvJKy2KtV1794199663.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西九龍美孚萬事達第三分行分區營業經理馮健平表示，中原最新促成一宗美孚新邨租賃成交，單位為7期萬事達廣場5號中層C室，實用面積658平方呎，採兩房間隔，單位座向南方，望街景，最新以25800元租出，折合實用呎租39元。</p><p><br/>中原地產馮健平指，上址業主於2016年3月以650萬元購入上址，持貨10年，是次租出單位可享高達4.8厘租金回報，回報率理想。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.336560+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.153294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.635112+00:00","content_hash":"8ec68be1ee60ab27458016ac26ddcf95423da45d8207c170f2ba1cbfdd977aa9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.336560+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}